<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $450 mln REMIC 1997-26.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $450 mln REMIC 1997-26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it issued $450 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities via Greenwich Capital Markets Inc.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-26 is backed by 30-year, 8.0-percent mortgage certificates, the agency said.</p>
<p>The issue prices on March 4 and has a settlement date of April 30, it said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
